{
  "name": "dsh-guard",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Startup watchdog + auto-rollback for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). If `dsh web` fails to boot after installing a plugin, it disables the offending plugin (keeps it downloaded) and retries — so a bad plugin never bricks your profile.",
